# UI + Theme

**Unify rule:** New UI = existing shell + objects + tokens. No second design system. No competitor skins.

Sources: `frontend/src/index.css`, `tailwind.config.js`, `components/ui/*`, `plans/00-ui-objects.md`.

## Tokens (frozen)

| Role | Value / class |
|------|----------------|
| App bg | `#fafbfc` + `.app-page-bg` |
| Text | `#0b1220` (`foreground`), muted `#5c6b7a` |
| Card | white, `rounded-2xl`, `border-border`, `shadow-sm` |
| Accent | `#2563eb` (`.btn-save`) |
| Navy | `#0f2744` / `#1a3a5c` (sidebar / primary) |
| AI only | violet-50 / violet-600 + Sparkles |
| Portal font | Inter (`.font-app`) |
| Auth font | Plus Jakarta Sans (`.font-website`) |

Do not invent new palettes, fonts, or radii. Prefer theme Tailwind classes (`text-foreground`, `bg-surface`, `border-border`, `text-accent`) over raw hex in components.

## Typography & chrome

- Portals: `PortalLayout` + `PortalSidebar` + `.font-app`.
- Auth/marketing: `.login-page-bg` + `.auth-card` + `.font-website` — never for in-app workflows.
- Icons: `lucide-react` (14–20px rows, 20–22px headers).

### Slim management lists (min 12px)

For questionnaire / procedure / contract / tender / department / invite / supplier-search style pages using `QuestionnaireSlimRow`, `StatusBadge`, `RowActionButton`, or compact search cards:

| Element | Min size | Tailwind |
|---------|----------|----------|
| Row title | 14px | `text-sm` |
| Description, meta, actions, badges, card secondary text | **12px** | `text-xs` |

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — too small to read in dense lists
<span className="text-[10px]">…</span>
<p className="text-[11px] text-muted">…</p>

// ✅ GOOD
<p className="text-sm font-semibold">Title</p>
<span className="text-xs text-muted">Meta</span>
<StatusBadge>…</StatusBadge> // text-xs inside
```

Do not use `text-[10px]` / `text-[11px]` on these list UIs. Compact padding is fine; font size stays ≥ 12px.

### Dashboards & popups (headings 16 / body 14)

Portal tab pages, home dashboards, `SlideOver`, `CenterModal`, and other modals:

| Element | Size | Tailwind |
|---------|------|----------|
| Page / modal / slide-over title (`h2`/`h3`) | **16px** | `text-base font-bold` |
| Normal body / subtitle / form labels | **14px** | `text-sm` |
| Dense list meta on those pages | **12px** | `text-xs` (still min) |

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<h2 className="text-2xl font-bold">…</h2>
<h2 className="text-xl font-bold">…</h2>
<p className="text-[11px]">…</p>

// ✅ GOOD
<h2 className="text-base font-bold text-foreground">…</h2>
<p className="text-sm text-muted">…</p>
```

KPI / stat **numbers** may stay larger (`text-2xl` etc.). Avatar initials and logo markups are exempt.

## UI object catalog

| Object | Use | Implement with |
|--------|-----|----------------|
| **PortalShell** | All portal screens | `PortalLayout` |
| **SidebarItem** | Top-level tabs | `PortalSidebar` items `{ id, label, icon }` |
| **ContentCard** | Sections / detail panels | `bg-white rounded-2xl border border-border shadow-sm` |
| **StatCard** | Home KPIs | `AdminStatCards` pattern |
| **SlimListRow** | Lists (tenders, bids, contracts, questionnaires) | `QuestionnaireSlimRow`: compact padding; title `text-sm`, meta ≥ `text-xs` (12px) |
| **StatusBadge** | Lifecycle pills | Tone badges; label ≥ `text-xs` (12px) |
| **RowActionButton** | Compact list actions | primary / secondary / danger / muted; label ≥ `text-xs` (12px) |
| **PrimaryButton** | Save, Publish, Submit | `.btn-save` |
| **ApproveButton** | Approve | `.btn-approve` |
| **RejectButton** | Reject / send back | `.btn-reject` |
| **CancelButton** | Dismiss | `.btn-cancel` |
| **DeleteButton** | Destructive | `.btn-delete` |
| **TextField** | Text inputs | `.input-brand` `rounded-xl` |
| **DateField** | Deadlines / validity | `DateOnlyPicker` (`YYYY-MM-DD`) |
| **SearchSelect** | CPV / similar pickers | `CpvSearchSelect`-style |
| **ProfileTabs** | Multi-section wizards | `*ProfileTabsNav` |
| **CompletenessRail** | Readiness checklist | `*ProfileCompleteness` |
| **Modal** | Short confirms / forms | `CenterModal` or `bg-black/50–60` + white `rounded-2xl` |
| **SlideOver** | Longer edit/detail | `SlideOver` (`open`, `onClose`, `title`, `footer?`) |
| **Toast** | Brief feedback | `useToast().showToast` |
| **Pagination** | Long lists | `ListPagination` + `useListPagination` |
| **EmptyState** | Empty / gated features | dashed `rounded-xl border-2 border-border` + hint/CTA |
| **AlertBanner** | Account / conflict notices | `AccountStatusBanner` or tinted `rounded-xl` |
| **AiAssistBar / AiDrawer / AiInlinePanel** | AI entry / review / suggestions | Violet `*AiAssist` compounds only |

## Composition defaults

| Screen type | Objects |
|-------------|---------|
| Role home | PortalShell, StatCard, SlimListRow, StatusBadge |
| Searchable list | SearchSelect/filters, SlimListRow, RowActionButton, Pagination, EmptyState |
| Create/edit long | SlideOver or ContentCard + TextField/DateField + PrimaryButton |
| Admin review | SlimListRow, Approve/Reject, Modal, Toast |
| AI assist | AiAssistBar / AiDrawer / AiInlinePanel (violet only) |

Every async view must support **loading**, **empty**, and **error** (toast or inline).

## Anti-patterns

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — new chrome / raw control / non-violet AI
<button className="bg-purple-600 rounded-full">Save</button>
<input className="border p-2" />
<div className="bg-indigo-50">AI tip</div>

// ✅ GOOD
<button className="btn-save rounded-xl px-4 py-2">{t('buttons.save')}</button>
<input className="input-brand w-full" />
// AI: reuse *AiAssist violet patterns only
```

- No second sidebar/nav outside PortalShell.
- No one-off modal styles when `SlideOver` / `CenterModal` fit.
- No auth page classes inside portals.
